# ============================================================
# Profile E — 4x RTX 5090, four independent replicas
# STATUS: UNTESTED
# ============================================================
# Every value below is a STARTING POINT, not a validated optimum.
# Nothing in this file has been benchmarked on real hardware yet.
# Fill in results/ before changing "UNTESTED" to a measured claim.
# Expected best aggregate-throughput architecture for 4 GPUs.
# Benchmark at 1/2/4/8/16 concurrent requests; record per-request latency AND
# total generated tok/s. Scaling will stop being linear once CPU, host memory
# bandwidth, request scheduling, or the router becomes the bottleneck — find
# that knee rather than assuming 4x.
. "$(dirname "${BASH_SOURCE[0]}")/_base.env"
GPUS=0,1,2,3
BASE_PORT=9000
CTX=131072
KV_K=q4_0
KV_V=q4_0
